    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "We present the progress we made during the current year on the web-based Knowledgebase of Fractures and Faults from a user’s prospective. The knowledgebase features concepts of fractures and faults, their formation mechanism, their geometry and distribution, and their petrophysical properties including their effect on fluid flow. Concepts in the knowledgebase are discussed and supplemented by closely related concepts, photos, figures, illustrations, equations, and references. Here, we will introduce our knowledgebase with a focus on carbonates to complement the related efforts in the workshop and field trip this year.",
